EN:
I wonder if I'd catch more fish{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
if I put a bit of {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}
on the end of my line. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Who knows?

TRANSLATION:
Acaba misinanın ucuna biraz {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} koysam daha çok balık
yakalar mıyım? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Kim bilir?

FR:
La pêche n'a aucun secret pour
moi ! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Chuis trop forte, d'abord !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sympa, cette pensée positive, hi hi !

Han là là, les trucs bizarres qui me
viennent en tête quand je pêche{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Des trucs limite intellectuels, hi hi !
